## How to use this Storybook

- **Toolbar (top)** — switch theme (light / dark{{IF_HIGH_CONTRAST}} / high-contrast{{/IF_HIGH_CONTRAST}}), direction (LTR / RTL){{IF_MULTI_BRAND}}, brand{{/IF_MULTI_BRAND}}, strict mode (off / on)
- **Component pages** show Live preview, interactive Controls, and All stories below the docs
- **Status banners** at the top of each page indicate fill state (✅ filled · 🟡 in-progress · 📋 placeholder · ⬜ empty)
- **Single source of truth**: this Storybook reads MDX directly from `docs/context/design-system/`. Same `.mdx` files serve human readers (rendered) and coding agents (read as markdown)

